;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%AF%E7%8A%B6%E6%B0%B4%E6%98%9F\" title=\"环状水星\"><img alt=\"环状水星\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%AF%E7%8A%B6%E6%B0%B4%E6%98%9F\" title=\"环状水星\">环状水星</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>永不沉没号</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：309503</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能一</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能二</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/技能一.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/技能二.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/3.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/大招.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/0.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3095/309503/入场.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">C区一层的舞池已被围得水泄不通。<br />迪斯科的音乐响起，聚光灯照在了舞池的中心——表演开始了。<br />烟雾从形似水母的焚香壶中飘散，它如同驯服的仆从，追随着女孩的手势，变成千奇百怪的样貌。<br />观众们看着眼前的一切，直到它结束。<br />这场表演并没有收获应有的掌声。<br />“——我想起了我的母亲。她在我年幼时就离开了我……没想到竟然能在这场表演里看见她……”妇人正失神地喃喃。<br />“如果我的孩子能活到现在，那他就会长成这个样子。”年迈的老者说道。<br />台下的人们沉浸在各自的情绪中，而台上的女孩只是静静地熄灭了那只焚香壶，她的身影随烟雾一同散去。<br />“一种疗愈，旅行的目的正在于此。”在沙龙主人询问表演目的时，女孩如此回答。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5b/Belonging-309504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“一叶灵感”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Fragment of Inspiration\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>轻薄透明、带有珠光的丝缎，与贝壳的彩色釉质相互映衬。<br />受访者观摩了演出礼服的整个定制过程后，留下了裁落的这一叶边角。她表示，任其废弃还为时过早，仍有刹那的灵感寄寓其中。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/Belonging-309505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“星的触摸”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Touch of the Star\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />53<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚镀银的扣针，倒映礼裙面料的色泽，在缭绕的烟雾中能够呈现水纹般的闪耀。<br />海星柔韧、简单，不依赖眼眸，而是利用身体洞察一切。<br />正如这件饰品的主人那样。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b9/Belonging-309506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“忒提丝煅火”\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">手提香炉</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Blessing of Thetis\" Censer</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />120<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一个手提香炉，装满热炭与乳香。由“午夜烟雾秀”的赞助商Eurybia提供，用以为宾客们奉香。<br />“这是‘海洋’系列最好的品牌活动之一。藉由她的表演，我们所推崇的时尚理念得以完美地诠释：灵性与本我。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 午夜曼波1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A21.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 午夜曼波2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9B%BC%E6%B3%A22.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">午夜曼波 <small style=\"color: grey\">Midnight Mistmancer</small></span></span>"}}